    "body": "Quick pass: good. Head `3d75878` merges cleanly with `main`. On this head, the quick gate (11 steps, 0 failed) and clippy of `camcraft-ui` are green. The `crates/ui` test count goes from 2019 to 2027, and no test was removed. An independent pre-review compared the table with the old labels, tips, shortcuts and enabled rules and found them the same, and found no blocking points.\n\nKnown gap, filed: at 1280×720 the viewport Display menu covers its button (#4491). The plan's smallest screen is 1366×768.\n\nSmall points for a later PR: shortcuts such as Del and Ctrl+S still fire while a menu popup is open (the typing guard is unchanged, but a popup can now be open), and Quit has a menu row in the browser build. I flag the PR ready for review.\n",
